{"seq":2,"slug":"fine-grained-shared","title":"细粒度与共享专家","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/mixture-of-experts/frontiers/fine-grained-shared","wordCount":1611,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"细粒度与共享专家\">细粒度与共享专家</h1><p>DeepSeekMoE 的两项设计——细粒度专家（fine-grained experts）与共享专家（shared experts）——是 2025–2026 年 MoE 架构最重要的演化，几乎被所有后来者采纳。它们各自针对前几代 MoE 的一个痛点：细粒度专家解决「专家太少太大、分化不开」（即 <a href=\"../training/expert-specialization\">专家专业化</a> 里的弱分化问题），共享专家解决「通用知识被重复存进每个专家、造成冗余」。两者合起来，把 MoE 从「少数大杂家」改造成「一组各有所长的小专家 + 一个共享的通才」。本篇深入这两个设计的动机、数学与组合效应。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>设想把同一份「专家容量预算」用两种方式切分：标准粒度切成少数大专家，细粒度切成多数小专家。在激活算力相同的前提下，细粒度提供了<strong>组合数量级更多的专家激活组合</strong>，让路由器有更大的分化空间。共享专家则从总专家里划出固定一两个、对所有 token 常驻激活，专门吃通用负载。下表对比三种配置：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>配置</th>\n<th>专家数</th>\n<th>单专家大小</th>\n<th>共享专家</th>\n<th>分化空间</th>\n<th>冗余</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>标准粒度 (Mixtral)</td>\n<td>少 (8)</td>\n<td>大</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>小</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>细粒度 (DeepSeekMoE)</td>\n<td>多 (256)</td>\n<td>小</td>\n<td>有 (1)</td>\n<td>大</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>细粒度+共享 (主流)</td>\n<td>多 + 1–2 共享</td>\n<td>小</td>\n<td>有</td>\n<td>大</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  X[token x] --&gt; SH[共享专家&lt;br/&gt;始终激活: 通用知识]&#10;  X --&gt; R[路由器]&#10;  R --&gt;|top-k 选细粒度| E1[路由专家 a]&#10;  R --&gt;|top-k 选细粒度| E2[路由专家 b]&#10;  R -.大量未选.-&gt; EN[路由专家 ...256]&#10;  SH --&gt; SUM[加权合并]&#10;  E1 --&gt; SUM&#10;  E2 --&gt; SUM&#10;  SUM --&gt; Y[输出]\">flowchart TD\n  X[token x] --&gt; SH[共享专家&lt;br/&gt;始终激活: 通用知识]\n  X --&gt; R[路由器]\n  R --&gt;|top-k 选细粒度| E1[路由专家 a]\n  R --&gt;|top-k 选细粒度| E2[路由专家 b]\n  R -.大量未选.-&gt; EN[路由专家 ...256]\n  SH --&gt; SUM[加权合并]\n  E1 --&gt; SUM\n  E2 --&gt; SUM\n  SUM --&gt; Y[输出]</pre><h2 id=\"细粒度专家-把组合空间放大\">细粒度专家：把组合空间放大</h2><p>细粒度的核心论证是组合学。设总共激活 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 个专家。若专家总数为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>，则可能的激活组合数约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"0px\"><mi>N</mi><mi>k</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\binom{N}{k}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2723em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9223em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.355em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.144em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。把每个专家切成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 份（专家数变 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">mN</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>、每个变小为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span>、激活数也按比例变 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">mk</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">mk</span></span></span></span></span> 以保持算力不变），组合数变成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"0px\"><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\binom{mN}{mk}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2723em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9223em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.355em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">mk</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.144em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，随 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 增大而暴涨。</p>\n<p>更多的组合意味着路由器能为不同输入拼出更精细的专家集合，每个专家也能聚焦更窄的功能、分化更干净。DeepSeekMoE 把这一思路落到 256 个路由专家、top-8 的配置上，相比 Mixtral 的 8 专家 top-2，组合空间不在一个量级。代价是路由器要在更多专家上打分、all-to-all 涉及更多目标（见 <a href=\"../systems/memory-communication\">显存与通信</a>），以及对负载均衡的要求更高——细粒度让每个专家的负载更易抖动，正是无辅助损失偏置法（见 <a href=\"../training/load-balancing\">负载均衡与辅助损失</a>）的用武之地。</p>\n<h2 id=\"共享专家-把通用知识抽出来\">共享专家：把通用知识抽出来</h2><p>细粒度解决了分化空间，但还有一类冗余它治不了：每个专家都得各自掌握一份基础语言能力。共享专家的设计是把这份「人人都要的通用知识」从路由专家里抽出来，集中到一两个对所有 token 始终激活的专家里。层的输出因此变成「共享专家 + top-k 路由专家」之和：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>Shared</mtext></mrow></munder><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>TopK</mtext></mrow></munder><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y = \\sum_{s \\in \\text{Shared}} E_s(x) + \\sum_{i \\in \\text{TopK}} g_i(x) \\cdot E_i(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3795em;vertical-align:-1.3295em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">Shared</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3295em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4804em;vertical-align:-1.4304em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">TopK</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4304em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>共享专家不经路由、恒定激活，承担通用负载；路由专家则被解放出来，不必再重复存储基础能力，可以专注学真正特异的模式。这直接降低了 <a href=\"../training/expert-specialization\">专家专业化</a> 里讨论的冗余，让有限的专家容量花在刀刃上。DeepSpeed-MoE 还观察到，把共享专家在每个 worker 上复制一份，可减少跨设备 all-to-all 通信——共享专家恒定激活的特性恰好让它适合本地化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"两者的组合效应与权衡\">两者的组合效应与权衡</h2><p>细粒度与共享专家不是各自为政，而是互补放大。细粒度把分化空间做大、共享专家把通用负载抽走，二者叠加让「路由专家专注特异、共享专家兜底通用」的分工成立——这就是 2026 年主流 MoE 的骨架。实证上，DeepSeek 报告这套组合在等激活算力下显著优于标准粒度 MoE，且专家分化更清晰、可解释。</p>\n<p>但组合不是免费的。细粒度推高路由开销与对均衡的敏感度；共享专家恒定激活意味着它吃掉一部分固定算力预算，共享专家设几个、占多大，是质量与算力的权衡。还有一个开放问题：共享专家数与路由专家数的最优配比尚无定论，各家凭经验取 1–2 个共享。这些悬而未决之处，连同 MoE 整体的开放挑战，留待 <a href=\"challenges-future\">挑战与未来</a> 收束。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从稠密-upcycling-到细粒度的迁移\">从稠密 upcycling 到细粒度的迁移</h2><p>细粒度与共享专家不仅影响从零训练，也改变了「把稠密模型改造成 MoE」（upcycling）的玩法。最朴素的 upcycling 是把稠密 FFN 复制 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 份当作 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 个标准粒度专家、再续训。但既然 2026 范式已收敛到细粒度，更现代的做法是把稠密 FFN 沿隐藏维<strong>切分</strong>成多个小专家，而非整体复制——这样初始化天然就是细粒度的，续训时分化空间更大。</p>\n<p>共享专家在 upcycling 里有个特别自然的角色：直接用原稠密 FFN（或其一份拷贝）当共享专家，因为它本就承载着完整的通用能力，恰好胜任「兜底通用知识」的职责；再把额外的容量切成细粒度路由专家去学新分工。这种「稠密 FFN 当共享专家 + 新增细粒度路由专家」的 upcycling 配方，能在远少于从零训练的算力下得到一个带分化能力的 MoE。它也反过来印证了共享专家的设计直觉（见 <a href=\"../training/expert-specialization\">专家专业化</a> 的冗余分析）：通用知识本就该集中存一份，无论是训练得到还是从稠密模型继承而来。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>细粒度专家与共享专家是 DeepSeekMoE 的两项核心设计，已成 2026 年 MoE 主流骨架。</li>\n<li>细粒度把专家切小切多，激活组合数从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"0px\"><mi>N</mi><mi>k</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\binom{N}{k}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2723em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9223em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.355em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.144em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 涨到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"0px\"><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\binom{mN}{mk}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2723em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9223em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.355em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">mk</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.144em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，放大分化空间，代价是路由与均衡更难。</li>\n<li>共享专家把通用知识抽出、恒定激活，解放路由专家去学特异模式，直接降低冗余。</li>\n<li>两者互补：细粒度扩分化空间、共享专家兜底通用，形成「特异路由 + 通用共享」的分工。</li>\n<li>共享专家恒占固定算力、与路由专家的最优配比尚无定论，属待解问题，详见挑战与未来篇。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>来源：<a href=\"https://www.emergentmind.com/topics/deepseekmoe-architecture\">DeepSeekMoE Architecture Overview (emergentmind)</a>、<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2412.19437\">DeepSeek-V3 Technical Report (arXiv:2412.19437)</a>、<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2407.06204\">A Survey on Mixture of Experts in LLMs (arXiv:2407.06204)</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"细粒度与共享专家","id":"细粒度与共享专家"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"细粒度专家：把组合空间放大","id":"细粒度专家-把组合空间放大"},{"level":2,"text":"共享专家：把通用知识抽出来","id":"共享专家-把通用知识抽出来"},{"level":2,"text":"两者的组合效应与权衡","id":"两者的组合效应与权衡"},{"level":2,"text":"从稠密 upcycling 到细粒度的迁移","id":"从稠密-upcycling-到细粒度的迁移"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"主流 MoE 大模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/mixture-of-experts/frontiers/moe-llms"},"next":{"title":"挑战与未来","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/mixture-of-experts/frontiers/challenges-future"}}